│     AggregatingTransform                                                   │
│       (Expression)                                                         │
│       ExpressionTransform                                                  │
│         (ReadFromMergeTree)                                                │
│         MergeTreeSelect(pool: PrefetchedReadPool, algorithm: Thread) 0 → 1 │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

